# Demo runbooks and recordings built against a real client corpus. These name
# the company, quote its copy, and carry local paths - they stay on the machine
# that made them. This repository is public.
*-demo-runbook.md
*.cast

# Worktrees Claude Code creates for isolated sessions. These are full nested
# checkouts, node_modules and all, living inside the repository - so an
# unguarded `git add -A` from the root would stage an entire second copy of
# the project. Ignored rather than moved: the location is the tool's, not ours.
.claude/
